1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,770
They send two at the ball!

2
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:04,430
Your big catches the short roll.

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,450
Four on three.

4
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:08,670
Looks easy... until the help moves.

5
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:10,950
Drive? Corner? Or cut?

6
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:15,110
Drive? The help is already there.

7
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:17,350
Corner? His defender never left.

8
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:20,230
Now watch the weak-side defender.

9
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,680
He steps into the paint...

10
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,250
and loses the cutter!

11
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:24,390
There's the pass!

12
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:27,800
Read the help.

13
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:29,510
Attack the space it leaves.

14
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:30,750
Did you see it?

